    "scenesThatPass": [
      "REGAN: Sorry to disturb you.\nTUSKIN: What is it, Regan?\nREGAN: Gene, I've changed my mind. I'd like to do it after all.\nTUSKIN: Fine.",
      "TUSKIN: What happened?\nREGAN: Are you all right? Tuskin nods. Regan is very relieved .",
      "TUSKIN: Do you remember anything?\nREGAN: Was it in Africa?\nREGAN: It was like something I saw with our class at the Natural History Museum.\nTUSKIN: You weren't supposed to remember anything.",
      "SANDRA: Mother, it's all right ...\nTUSKIN: What is it?",
      "TUSKIN: All right! Take her home. Liz, you go with them.\nTUSKIN: What did you do?\nREGAN: Nothing. I just started ·talking to her. First she was talking inside, and then she was talking outside.\nREGAN: Gene, do you think I could help some of your other kids?"
    ]
